@EduBoost.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@Token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Health
GET {{EduBoost.API_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Login (student)
# @name login
POST {{EduBoost.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@eduboost.local",
  "password": "student123"
}

###

### My progress
GET {{EduBoost.API_HostAddress}}/api/students/me/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Enrolled classes
GET {{EduBoost.API_HostAddress}}/api/classes/enrolled
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json
